! Drift-Ward ~ the record

The gauge speaks at <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/drift-ward`>>; its rulings stand in that meme's <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/drift-ward#/rulings`>>.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/hud-panel`>>

!! The `hud` panel

The gauge's panel first rode a `hud` sigil; the boot seed's `set` sigil carries it as the `drift-ward` key. Verbatim:

> ''Every turn carries a Drift-Ward reading, twice.'' The `hud` panel holds it ~ fired at open, fired again at close: one axis, measured from two positions.
>
> ''`hud` carries the gauge'' ~ LAST at open, FIRST at close, so the panel mirrors itself and the chiasmus holds inside one sigil.
>
> ''Turn order:'' `aim` · `hud` · content · `oracle` · `hud` · `yield`.
>
> (operator ruling: canon writes no `Focus`/`Feedback` spelling; captured turns still carry it, and the harvester reads both)

<<~/ahu>>

